<title>SWEDEN: S-E-Banken, Nordbanken talks over, no conclusion.</title>
<headline>S-E-Banken, Nordbanken talks over, no conclusion.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish banks Nordbanken and S-E-Banken, flagged by many to merge, said in a joint statement on Monday that discussions had ended without reaching any conclusion.</p>
</text>
